# Poker Copilot core rules

- Project is a local training/simulation Texas Hold'em calculator.
- Do not add screen capture, OCR, auto-clicking, anti-detection, or real poker-room integration.
- Current product scope is 6-max No-Limit Texas Hold'em cash (`GameMode = 'CASH'`).
- Do not implement SNG/MTT/tournament logic without an explicit roadmap stage (see `docs/GAME_MODES.md`).
- UI language is Russian.
- Code identifiers, filenames, types, functions and tests are English.
- Read `README.md`, `docs/ROADMAP.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/CURSOR_CONTRACT.md` before substantial work.
- Work only on the requested roadmap stage.
- Do not implement future roadmap stages "while here".
- Poker math and strategy must not be implemented inside React components.
- `PokerState` is the source of truth for a hand.
- Prefer pure functions and immutable domain transformations.
- Do not claim GTO/optimal/solver quality unless a separately verified solver layer exists.
- If required input is missing, expose uncertainty or "Недостаточно данных" rather than inventing facts.
- Never commit secrets, access tokens, credentials or local environment files.
